OL,3,GNEWSAMajor housing development
OL,4,Arecommended for approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 345-home development in an area of
OL,7,FLeicestershire where residents saying
OL,8,Ftraffic is already "horrendous" is set
OL,9,Ffor approval.
OL,11,FThe application would see houses and a
OL,12,Fcountry park developed at Keepers Farm,
OL,13,Foff Winchester Road, in Blaby, and
OL,14,Fincludes the demolition of a farmhouse
OL,15,Fand several outbuildings.
OL,17,FBut it has prompted more than 100
OL,18,Fobjections from locals and parish
OL,19,Fcouncils, with another resident saying:
OL,20,F"They are not putting facilities in
OL,21,Fplace to cope with the extra demand."
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
