OL,3,GNEWSAMajor housing development
OL,4,Arecommended for approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlaby District Council (BDC) planning
OL,7,Fofficers have recommended the scheme
OL,8,Ffor approval, subject to conditions,
OL,9,Fand it will be discussed at its
OL,10,Fplanning committee on 1 October.
